# Regenerable, and large. Nothing here is a result -- results/ holds the JSON
# the tables are built from, and it is small enough to keep.
#
#   inputs/     385 MB  saved operand tensors. Regenerated bit-identically by
#                       common._gen() from a fixed seed, so committing them buys
#                       nothing that the seed does not already guarantee.
#   .torch_ext/ 310 MB  ninja build tree for the load_inline extensions.
#   artifacts/   54 MB  PTX/SASS/cubin dumps and ncu CSVs. The *census* of these
#                       (results/code_inspection.json, results/ncu_matched.json)
#                       is what the report reads; the raw dumps are for looking
#                       at by hand.
#
# artifacts/figs/ is the exception -- the report embeds those images.

inputs/
.torch_ext/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/figs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
